{"id":"khotya","lemma":"хотя","pos":"conj","rank":201,"glosses":["although, though (contrasting two clauses)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/17/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты можешь хотя бы до завтра подождать?","en":"Can you at least wait until tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"would"},null,null,{"g":"to wait"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"until tomorrow"]]},{"text":"Вы можете хотя бы попробовать?","en":"Can you at least try?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"would"},{"g":"to test"}]},{"text":"Можно нам хотя бы сесть?","en":"Can we at least sit down?","words":[{"g":"one can, one may"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"would"},{"g":"to sit down"}]},{"text":"Давай хотя бы поговорим об этом.","en":"Let's at least talk about it.","words":[{"g":"let's"},null,{"g":"would"},{"g":"to have a conversation","l":"поговорить"},{"g":"about"},null]},{"text":"Том мог бы хотя бы извиниться.","en":"Tom might at least apologize.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/263743","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"would"},null,{"g":"would"},{"g":"to apologize"}]}]}